  itemDescription: "Carbon Management Technologies Institute  This institute addresses
    climate change by developing technologies for carbon management \u2013 including
    carbon capture, utilization, and storage (CCUS), as well as carbon footprint
    reduction techniques. Its focus spans capturing CO\u2082 from industrial emissions,
    converting CO\u2082 into useful products (like fuels or building materials),
    and enhancing natural carbon sinks. The institute\u2019s mission aligns with
    Saudi Arabia\u2019s circular carbon economy initiative: to reduce carbon emissions
    and mitigate climate change while enabling sustainable industrial growth. Research
    also covers greenhouse gas monitoring and policies for carbon reduction"
